Movie Recommendation System

A content-based Movie Recommendation System built using Python and Machine Learning techniques. The system recommends movies similar to a user's selected movie by analyzing textual features such as genres, keywords, cast, crew, and overview.

## Features
- Content-based recommendation
- TF-IDF Vectorization
- Cosine Similarity
- Interactive movie search
- Recommends similar movies instantly

## Tech Stack
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- NLTK
- Jupyter Notebook

## Machine Learning Concepts Used

- Natural Language Processing (NLP)
- TF-IDF Vectorization
- Cosine Similarity

## Dataset
movies_metadata Dataset

## Project Workflow
1. Load and preprocess movie dataset.
2. Combine relevant textual features.
3. Convert text into numerical vectors using TF-IDF.
4. Calculate cosine similarity between movies.
5. Recommend the most similar movies based on user input.

## Results
The system recommends movies similar to the selected movie based on content similarity.

